config PACKAGE_tropicctl
	bool "tropicctl - command-line tool for the TROPIC01 secure element"
	depends on PACKAGE_libtropic
	select PACKAGE_libopenssl
	help
	  tropicctl talks to a TROPIC01 secure element over Linux SPI and GPIO:
	  chip and firmware information, random numbers, ECC keys, R-MEM data,
	  pairing keys, the chip configuration, MAC-and-Destroy PIN verification
	  and monotonic counters. Every command has a safety class; commands that
	  cannot be undone need an explicit confirmation flag.

	  Started under the name lt-util (a symlink this package installs) it
	  accepts the old lt-util command line.
